<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Baron Bay - 125,000 tonnes Hampton Roads/Rotterdam 15-30/3 $5.75 per ldt fio three days shinc/25,000 shinc Kleimar.</p>
<p>Loire Ore - 120,000 tonnes Hampton Roads/Ijmuiden 18-28/2 $5.40 fio six days shinc Cetragpa.</p>
<p>ORE - Comanche - 140,000 tonnes Brazil/two trips China 10-20/3 $9.60 fio scale load/30,000 shinc Kleimar.</p>
</text>
